  "text": "module sync_reset #\n(\n    parameter N = 2\n)\n(\n    input  wire clk,\n    input  wire rst,\n    output wire out\n);\n\n    reg [N-1:0] counter;\n\n    always @(posedge clk or posedge rst) begin\n        if (rst) begin\n            counter <= 0;\n            out     <= 1'b1;\n        end else begin\n            counter <= counter + 1;\n            if (counter == N)\n                out <= 1'b0;\n            else\n                out <= 1'b1;\n        end\n    end\n\nendmodule<|im_end|>\n<|endoftext|>",
